.SS GET_MIDR
.IP
.EX
#define GET_MIDR(VARIABLE)
#define get_midr(variable)
.EE
.PP
Sets the value of the \f[CR]MIDR\f[R] register to your variable.
.PP
Example:
.IP
.EX
unsigned int midr = 0;

get_midr(midr);

printf(\(dq%x\(rsn\(dq, midr); \f[I]// CPU Main ID Register value\f[R]
.EE
